      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i shouldn't feel this way but it feels so logical. like, everything is just decaying. the house, my health, my mind... it's all just a long, slow decline. it feels like i'm just watching a movie that's already ended, and i'm just sitting here in the dark waiting for the credits to roll. it's exhausting just existing like this.",
